WEBVTT

00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:09.525
Chat is where your team talks, and where a conversation can become a ticket or a doc. In this video, you’ll use a channel and turn messages into a ticket.

00:00:10.547 --> 00:00:16.904
Open Chat. There’s a channel for each store, crew, or project, and private direct messages underneath.

00:00:17.926 --> 00:00:23.409
Messages have reactions and photos, and a ticket that came from the chat links right back to it.

00:00:24.435 --> 00:00:28.744
Something needs doing? Click Select messages, and pick the ones that matter.

00:00:30.434 --> 00:00:36.727
Then Make ticket, or Make doc. The conversation goes with it, and the messages link to what they became.

00:00:39.284 --> 00:00:46.793
Ask Assist to summarize a channel, or what was decided. Chat is off until your System Admin turns it on in Modules.
